# Allow-list: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies. Anything
# else — project/.env with its API keys, raw PDFs, evaluation outputs, feedback —
# never reaches the builder, even by accident.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!scripts/fetch_models.py
!artifacts/vector_db/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
